<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>IndieHOT 独立游戏热点</title><link>https://staroltest.github.io/indie-game-hot/</link><description>IndieHOT 每天从一批独立游戏信源里收动态，按规则打分精选：引擎与工具、发行与宣发、开发日志、行业与融资、展会与活动、评测与复盘。只显示标题、一句自己写简介与原文链接，不转载全文。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 23:35:34 GMT</lastBuildDate><item><title>用 Unreal Engine 把 Anyma 的 Coachella 演出扩展为广播 AR</title><link>https://www.unrealengine.com/spotlights/expanding-anymas-coachella-performance-into-broadcast-ar-with-unreal-engine</link><description>Anyma 的 Coachella 现场借助 Unreal Engine、MetaHuman 与广播 AR 技术，把音乐视觉体验带给了线上观众。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">337da5318251a6bfe1b582440f1fa57277a240c1</guid><source url="https://www.unrealengine.com/spotlights/expanding-anymas-coachella-performance-into-broadcast-ar-with-unreal-engine">Unreal Engine 博客</source></item><item><title>用 UE5 还原《Bluey》标志性 2D 画风：Gameloft Brisbane 的开发访谈</title><link>https://www.unrealengine.com/developer-interviews/say-cheese-recreating-an-iconic-2d-art-style-with-ue5-in-blueys-happy-snaps</link><description>Gameloft Brisbane 团队分享如何用 Unreal Engine 5 的动画工具，把热门儿童动画《Bluey》的 2D 世界搬进 3D 游戏。</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">b5f0043cd5b8425b97593ce35c3a133329a61b70</guid><source url="https://www.unrealengine.com/developer-interviews/say-cheese-recreating-an-iconic-2d-art-style-with-ue5-in-blueys-happy-snaps">Unreal Engine 博客</source></item><item><title>Unity CLI 1.0 正式发布！</title><link>https://unity.com/the-unity-cli-1.0-is-here</link><description>Unity 命令行工具走出测试版，开发者可把 Claude Code 等 AI 编程助手接进 Unity 项目，在终端里自动跑构建和测试。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">c31d0d34a17ff92ab6443e4ceed4062fe025d009</guid><source url="https://unity.com/the-unity-cli-1.0-is-here">Unity 博客</source></item><item><title>新一波单人 AI 游戏制作者赚到钱了吗？并没有</title><link>https://mobilegamer.biz/are-the-new-wave-of-solo-ai-game-makers-making-any-money-no-not-really</link><description>用 Claude Code 等 AI 工具做的游戏正涌入应用商店，但真正赚到钱或获得下载量的寥寥无几，单人 AI 开发的变现现实远比热度冷清。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 16:19:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">e17dc5b4c9c27b40eaf0fe5ec13cc3beff8d9cd5</guid><source url="https://mobilegamer.biz/are-the-new-wave-of-solo-ai-game-makers-making-any-money-no-not-really">MobileGamer.biz</source></item><item><title>Unite Tokyo 2026 主题演讲回顾：为你的创意速度而生</title><link>https://unity.com/blog/unite-tokyo-2026-keynote-recap</link><description>Unity 7、面向所有人的 ECS、Unity CLI、Synty Studios 加入 Unity 以及全新 Unity Fellowship，一次看完 Unite Tokyo 2026 主题演讲的全部要点。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">95bd7b59d4114444d1502b6bf750928c8691292d</guid><source url="https://unity.com/blog/unite-tokyo-2026-keynote-recap">Unity 博客</source></item><item><title>《Wild Shift》开发日志 #6：我在草丛里找不到自己的 @</title><link>https://dev.to/basteez/wild-shift-devlog-6-i-couldnt-find-my-own--2kbm</link><description>参加 GitHub Game Off 2026 的 ASCII 风格小游戏《Wild Shift》更新了第六篇开发日志，作者分享了玩家角色在满屏同色字符里“隐身”的小插曲，以及为此做的可读性调整。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 18:14:06 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">34359921ffb94fc6db2e47ed9f2bd2c94018b24a</guid><source url="https://dev.to/basteez/wild-shift-devlog-6-i-couldnt-find-my-own--2kbm">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>BeamNG.drive 如何把柔体物理搬上 PS5</title><link>https://80.lv/articles/how-beamng-drive-brought-its-soft-body-physics-to-ps5</link><description>BeamNG 团队分享在 PS5 上完整保留柔体物理的做法，讲他们如何针对主机优化内存与性能。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 20:07:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">b4548191cad6ee15ad071122209764cb6ea31cc1</guid><source url="https://80.lv/articles/how-beamng-drive-brought-its-soft-body-physics-to-ps5">80 Level</source></item><item><title>我如何为几款经典 PC 游戏写了非官方原生 64 位 Linux/ARM64 SDL2 引擎</title><link>https://dev.to/aionedge/how-i-built-unofficial-native-64-bit-linuxarm64-sdl2-engines-for-a-few-classic-pc-games-2694</link><description>作者分享自己为几款老游戏手写原生 64 位 Linux 与 ARM64 引擎的技术笔记，让它们摆脱 Wine 与旧 32 位环境的束缚。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 21:18:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">09abe47809036a41c1a8ea64ad61adc3ddca23e8</guid><source url="https://dev.to/aionedge/how-i-built-unofficial-native-64-bit-linuxarm64-sdl2-engines-for-a-few-classic-pc-games-2694">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>Spine 对比 Exode：游戏骨骼动画与界面骨骼动画之争</title><link>https://dev.to/shinoj_cm_6b559b3ab51bf47/spine-vs-exode-skeletal-animation-for-games-vs-skeletal-animation-for-interfaces-4oab</link><description>Spine 是游戏 2D 骨骼动画十余年的默认选择，Exode 近一年补齐了骨骼、IK 与权重绘制，两者功能表面重叠，实则面向不同的产物，选错会浪费数月，文章具体划清了各自的适用边界。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 22:24:37 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">67deaa1a246e0e0931d393934ba4868c6845acde</guid><source url="https://dev.to/shinoj_cm_6b559b3ab51bf47/spine-vs-exode-skeletal-animation-for-games-vs-skeletal-animation-for-interfaces-4oab">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>gta4-reversed：用 C++20 运行时重实现 GTA IV，进度突破 1%</title><link>https://dev.to/master4824/gta4-reversed-starting-a-c20-runtime-reimplementation-of-gta-iv-1070-crossing-1-e5</link><description>这个开源项目直接对 PC 版 GTA IV 1.0.7.0 可执行文件做运行时 ASI 注入重写，现已实现 462 个函数、跨过 1% 里程碑，代码按 MIT 协议开源。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 23:00:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">002cd5ef16f3d8854b3bcc8c5ddea938d10320bb</guid><source url="https://dev.to/master4824/gta4-reversed-starting-a-c20-runtime-reimplementation-of-gta-iv-1070-crossing-1-e5">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>用这套优化工具包让 Unreal Engine 5 项目保持干净</title><link>https://80.lv/articles/keep-unreal-engine-5-projects-clean-with-this-optimization-toolkit</link><description>Leartes Studios 的编辑器扩展能给项目健康度打分、找出闲置资产并梳理依赖关系，帮 UE5 开发者把项目里的杂物清出去。</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 13:11:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">3ce9d8e2ac71fd8d4ee2e710010b525e54322835</guid><source url="https://80.lv/articles/keep-unreal-engine-5-projects-clean-with-this-optimization-toolkit">80 Level</source></item><item><title>Sensor Tower：GTA 6 预购额超 14 亿美元，87% 来自终极版</title><link>https://www.gamesindustry.biz/sensor-tower-gta-6-pre-orders-exceed-14bn-with-87-for-the-ultimate-edition</link><description>预购数据透露了玩家对高价版本的接受度，值得关注 3A 大作的定价策略与版本分层。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 01:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">834fa9ad8d3bea420b598799b0d706ddfa44e302</guid><source url="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/sensor-tower-gta-6-pre-orders-exceed-14bn-with-87-for-the-ultimate-edition">GamesIndustry.biz</source></item><item><title>62 款微型浏览器游戏还在涨：Pop Recall 的每日发版日志</title><link>https://dev.to/poprecallgames/62-tiny-browser-games-and-counting-pop-recalls-daily-shipping-log-223</link><description>Pop Recall 四天前以 25 款纯原生 JavaScript 微型浏览器游戏上线，如今已涨到 62 款仍在每日更新；每款新游戏都要过同一套发版关卡——能通关、适配手机、暂停真正锁输入，上线后还要实测。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 03:02:53 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">bb9bea4dc38062e2a06ca03a97e91d08a3a23e97</guid><source url="https://dev.to/poprecallgames/62-tiny-browser-games-and-counting-pop-recalls-daily-shipping-log-223">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>用 HTML5 Canvas 与 WebSockets 打造实时多人棋盘游戏引擎：Ludo Classic 架构解析</title><link>https://dev.to/uchitchakma/building-a-real-time-multiplayer-board-game-engine-with-html5-canvas-websockets-the-architecture-10a4</link><description>作者拆解一款实时多人棋盘游戏的引擎架构，讲 Canvas 渲染与 WebSocket 同步如何支撑回合制对局。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 03:36:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">88e75b91ad9b7b716d17c88b0da6dd320118eb68</guid><source url="https://dev.to/uchitchakma/building-a-real-time-multiplayer-board-game-engine-with-html5-canvas-websockets-the-architecture-10a4">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>我做了一个 AI 助手，能用一句话聊天指令改 Unreal Engine 蓝图</title><link>https://dev.to/dola_ai_pro/i-built-an-ai-agent-that-edits-unreal-engine-blueprints-from-a-chat-prompt-3d4d</link><description>独立开发者花一年做的 Dola AI 嵌进 UE5 编辑器里，用自然语言描述需求就能让多智能体改蓝图、写 C++ 并自动试玩验证，文章讲了它怎么工作、还差在哪。</descript