link><description>长对话带来两个制作难题：如何生成可信的面部表演、又如何让表演在整场戏里保持一致，本文探讨用音频驱动的方案来解决。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 11:31:07 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">5b5cd8a0689dbe288e4d61c0012a82c51c5906eb</guid><source url="https://gamedev.net/blogs/entry/2298677-exploring-audio-driven-facial-performance-for-longer-npc-dialogue">GameDev.net</source></item><item><title>开源图像工作台 TexForge 发布：为游戏美术与批量处理而生</title><link>https://dev.to/nan_nan_d86f644d31091c00f/texforge-is-out-a-open-source-image-workbench-for-games-and-batch-work-3e66</link><description>一款 MIT 协议的跨平台桌面工具，把法线贴图、通道打包、Mipmap 链与批量处理等 113 个图像操作收进一个工作台，覆盖 Unity、Unreal、Godot 等引擎的美术管线。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 12:16:42 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">e92695680c30baac1334940ad3057439da383600</guid><source url="https://dev.to/nan_nan_d86f644d31091c00f/texforge-is-out-a-open-source-image-workbench-for-games-and-batch-work-3e66">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item></channel></rss>
